Linux System Information Report

Project Overview

This project is developed using Bash Shell Scripting on Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL 10).

The script automatically collects important Linux system information and generates a report in a text file.

Technologies Used

- Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10
- Bash Shell Scripting
- Linux Commands
- Git & GitHub

Features

- Hostname information
- Operating system details
- Kernel version
- System uptime
- CPU information
- RAM utilization
- Disk space utilization
- IP address information
- Automatic report generation

